{
  "info": {
    "name": "Academic Reminder - Final Integrator Project",
    "description": "Colección completa y ordenada para ejecutar con Collection Runner. Todos los endpoints pasan por Nginx. Configure el environment, complete las credenciales demo de Cognito y ejecute las carpetas 00 a 07. El caso 503 de la carpeta 08 es manual y se omite salvo que runUnavailableCase=true.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key":"baseUrl","value":"http://localhost:9090"},
    {"key":"cognitoRegion","value":"us-east-1"},
    {"key":"cognitoClientId","value":""}
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Response is never an unhandled 500', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Health",
      "description": "Comprueba los dos microservicios exclusivamente a través de Nginx.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"Users health","request":{"method":"GET","url":"{{baseUrl}}/health/users"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Users is healthy', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP'); });"]}}]},
        {"name":"Academic Reminder health","request":{"method":"GET","url":"{{baseUrl}}/health/academic-reminder"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Academic Reminder is healthy', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP'); });"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Cognito Authentication",
      "description": "Obtiene y guarda access tokens reales mediante USER_PASSWORD_AUTH. El app client debe ser público, sin client secret, y permitir este flujo.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"Authenticate professor","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/x-amz-json-1.1"},{"key":"X-Amz-Target","value":"AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognitoClientId}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{professorUsername}}\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{professorPassword}}\"\n  }\n}"},"url":"https://cognito-idp.{{cognitoRegion}}.amazonaws.com/"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor token returned', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const body = pm.response.json();","pm.expect(body.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;","pm.environment.set('professorAccessToken', body.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken);"]}}]},
        {"name":"Authenticate student","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/x-amz-json-1.1"},{"key":"X-Amz-Target","value":"AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognitoClientId}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{studentUsername}}\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{studentPassword}}\"\n  }\n}"},"url":"https://cognito-idp.{{cognitoRegion}}.amazonaws.com/"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student token returned', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const body = pm.response.json();","pm.expect(body.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;","pm.environment.set('studentAccessToken', body.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken);"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Users",
      "description": "Sincroniza perfiles con atributos obtenidos desde Cognito y prueba la API de usuarios.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"Get professor profile","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/users/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor profile synchronized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('ADMIN'); pm.environment.set('professorSub', pm.response.json().cognitoSub); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get student profile","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/users/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student profile synchronized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('STUDENT'); pm.environment.set('studentSub', pm.response.json().cognitoSub); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Update own profile","request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"fullName\": \"Evaluation Student\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/users/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Own profile updated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().fullName).to.eql('Evaluation Student');"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get student by subject","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/users/{{studentSub}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student lookup succeeds', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().cognitoSub).to.eql(pm.environment.get('studentSub')); pm.expect(pm.response.json().fullName).to.eql('Evaluation Student'); }"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Professor Setup",
      "description": "El profesor crea el curso y los recursos que usará el estudiante.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"Create course","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"name\": \"Enterprise Architecture {{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Collection Runner evaluation course\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Course created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) { const body = pm.response.json(); pm.environment.set('courseId', body.id); pm.environment.set('courseCode', body.joinCode); pm.environment.set('courseName', body.name); pm.expect(body.ownedByMe).to.be.true; }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Reject duplicate course","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"name\": \"  {{courseName}}  \",\n  \"description\": \"COLLECTION RUNNER EVALUATION COURSE\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Duplicate course is rejected', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));","if (pm.response.code === 409) pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include('mismo nombre y descripción');"]}}]},
        {"name":"List my courses as professor","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor courses listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get course","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Course found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().id)).to.eql(String(pm.environment.get('courseId')));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get course professor","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/professor"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor loaded through users service', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('ADMIN');"]}}]},
        {"name":"Create activity","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Architecture defense\",\n  \"description\": \"Present services, security and logs\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-15T18:00:00Z\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/activities"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activity created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) { const body = pm.response.json(); pm.environment.set('activityId', body.id); pm.expect(body.activityNumber).to.be.a('number').and.above(0); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Update activity","request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Architecture defense updated\",\n  \"description\": \"Present services, security, SQL and logs\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-16T18:00:00Z\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/activities/{{activityId}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activity updated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Create course reminder","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Submit final project\",\n  \"description\": \"Submit the repository URL\",\n  \"type\": \"PROJECT\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-20T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"priority\": \"URGENT\",\n  \"notificationOffsetsMinutes\": [60, 1440]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/reminders"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Course reminder created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.environment.set('courseReminderId', pm.response.json().id);"]}}]},
        {"name":"Professor creates priority category","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"name\": \"Professor Evaluation {{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"color\": \"#1D4ED8\",\n  \"sortOrder\": 2\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/priority-categories"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor category created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.environment.set('professorCategoryId', pm.response.json().id);"]}}]},
        {"name":"Professor creates personal reminder","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Prepare next class\",\n  \"description\": \"Personal professor reminder\",\n  \"type\": \"TASK\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-18T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"priorityCategoryId\": {{professorCategoryId}},\n  \"notificationOffsetsMinutes\": [30]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Professor personal reminder created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.environment.set('professorPersonalReminderId', pm.response.json().id); pm.expect(pm.response.json().personal).to.be.true; }"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Student Flows",
      "description": "El estudiante se inscribe y recorre categorías, actividades, recordatorios y notificaciones.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"Join course","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"code\": \"{{courseCode}}\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/join"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student joined course', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().memberCount).to.be.at.least(1);"]}}]},
        {"name":"List my courses as student","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student courses listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"List activities","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/activities"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activities listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;"]}}]},
        {"name":"Complete activity","request":{"method":"PATCH","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/activities/{{activityId}}/complete"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activity completed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { const body = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(body.completed).to.be.true; pm.expect(body.completedAt).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Undo activity completion","request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/activities/{{activityId}}/completion"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activity completion reverted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().completed).to.be.false; pm.expect(pm.response.json().completedAt ?? null).to.eql(null); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Complete activity again","request":{"method":"PATCH","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/activities/{{activityId}}/complete"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Activity can be completed after undo', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().completed).to.be.true;"]}}]},
        {"name":"Create priority category","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"name\": \"Evaluation {{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"color\": \"#7A5AF8\",\n  \"sortOrder\": 5\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/priority-categories"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Priority category created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.environment.set('categoryId', pm.response.json().id);"]}}]},
        {"name":"List priority categories","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/priority-categories"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Priority categories listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Create personal reminder","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Review architecture logs\",\n  \"description\": \"Prepare the demonstration\",\n  \"type\": \"TASK\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-14T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"priorityCategoryId\": {{categoryId}},\n  \"notificationOffsetsMinutes\": [30, 60]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Personal reminder created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));","if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.environment.set('personalReminderId', pm.response.json().id);"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get personal reminder","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{personalReminderId}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Personal reminder found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().personal).to.be.true;"]}}]},
        {"name":"Update personal reminder","request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Review complete architecture\",\n  \"description\": \"Prepare the final demonstration\",\n  \"type\": \"TASK\",\n  \"dueAt\": \"2035-08-15T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"priority\": \"URGENT\",\n  \"priorityCategoryId\": {{categoryId}},\n  \"notificationOffsetsMinutes\": [45]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{personalReminderId}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Personal reminder updated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().priority).to.eql('URGENT');"]}}]},
        {"name":"List my reminders","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/me"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Own reminders listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Get dashboard","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/dashboard"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Dashboard generated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json().reminders).to.be.an('array');"]}}]},
        {"name":"List course reminders","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/reminders"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Course reminders listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Override course reminder priority","request":{"method":"PATCH","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"priorityCategoryId\": {{categoryId}}\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{courseReminderId}}/priority"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Course priority customized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().customPriority.id)).to.eql(String(pm.environment.get('categoryId')));"]}}]},
        {"name":"List reminder notifications","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{courseReminderId}}/notifications"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Notifications listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;"]}}]},
        {"name":"Replace reminder notifications","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"offsetsMinutes\": [15, 120]\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{courseReminderId}}/notifications"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Notification schedule replaced', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.length(2); pm.environment.set('notificationId', pm.response.json()[0].id); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"List upcoming notifications","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/notifications/upcoming"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Upcoming notifications listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Delete notification","request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/notifications/{{notificationId}}"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Notification deleted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]}}]},
        {"name":"Complete personal reminder","request":{"method":"PATCH","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{personalReminderId}}/complete"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Personal reminder completed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('COMPLETED'); pm.expect(pm.response.json().completedAt).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Undo personal reminder completion","request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{personalReminderId}}/completion"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Reminder completion reverted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('PENDING'); pm.expect(pm.response.json().completedAt ?? null).to.eql(null); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Complete personal reminder again","request":{"method":"PATCH","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/reminders/{{personalReminderId}}/complete"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Reminder can be completed after undo', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Professor Verification",
      "description": "Verifica asistencia y visibilidad una vez que el estudiante ya está inscrito.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"List enrolled students","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/students"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Enrolled students listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { const students = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(students).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty; pm.expect(students.map(item => item.cognitoSub)).to.include(pm.environment.get('studentSub')); }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Professor sees activity completion history","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/activities"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Completion history is visible to course owner', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) { const activity = pm.response.json().find(item => String(item.id) === String(pm.environment.get('activityId'))); pm.expect(activity).to.exist; pm.expect(activity.completionCount).to.be.at.least(1); pm.expect(activity.completions.map(item => item.studentUserId)).to.include(pm.environment.get('studentSub')); pm.expect(activity.completions[0].completedAt).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; }"]}}]},
        {"name":"Record attendance","request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"studentUserId\": \"{{studentSub}}\",\n  \"attendanceDate\": \"2026-08-04\",\n  \"status\": \"PRESENT\"\n}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/attendance"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Attendance recorded', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.environment.set('attendanceId', pm.response.json().id);"]}}]},
        {"name":"List attendance","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/attendance"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Attendance listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;"]}}]},
        {"name":"Student lists only own attendance","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses/{{courseId}}/attendance"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Student attendance is isolated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.response.json().forEach(item => pm.expect(item.studentUserId).to.eql(pm.environment.get('studentSub')));"]}}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - Error and Authorization Cases",
      "description": "Casos inválidos con códigos HTTP estrictos y aserciones significativas.",
      "item": [
        {"name":"400 invalid course","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{professorAccessToken}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"name\":\"\"}"},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/academic-reminder/courses"},"event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"exec":["pm.test('Invalid payload returns 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));","pm.expect(pm.response.json().fieldErrors.name).to.exist;"]}}]},
